abstract: "Off-axis field retrieval, least-squares phase unwrapping and Rytov optical diffraction tomography with Gerchberg-Papoulis or FISTA total-variation missing-cone filling, and a beam propagation forward model and inversion for multiple scattering, on CPU and CUDA, with Python bindings."
